WEBVTT

00:04:57.035 --> 00:05:01.817
Chris Anderson: You guys didn't hear about us cutting out the Design from TED? (Laughter)

00:05:01.817 --> 00:05:03.567
[Two minutes later...]

00:05:03.567 --> 00:05:06.251
He ran into all sorts of problems in terms of managing the medical research part.

00:05:06.251 --> 00:05:08.814
It's happening!

00:05:08.814 --> 00:05:12.814
(Applause)